# Commits

- Tag-line commits only (`[ADD] ...`, `[FIX] ...`, etc.) - one tag per line, ≤72 chars, no trailing period
- No free-form commit body
- No Cursor / AI co-author trailers
- See `docs/GIT.md` (ops) or `CONTRIBUTING.md` (monitor)
- Install hooks: `./scripts/install-hooks.sh`
